# A page shared from its reader on a local accounts API: the Share dialog, its link, then the page
# in the tab rail's Shared section.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
signed-in
prefer themeId aura-noir
prefer starAsked true
replies pages.json
project storefront shop
patch pages-notes.diff
chat Wren
title "Cache the product pages"
say "Plan the product page cache and show me the numbers."
settle 10
key cmd-alt-8
settle 3
click 1057,69
settle 1
snap pages-share-dialog
key enter
hold 3
settle 1
snap pages-share-link
key escape
settle 1
snap pages-share-rail
